  "title": "HAL Launches New Shakti Engine Production Line in Odisha",
  "summary": "HAL plans to set up a new Shakti engine production line at the Koraput facility in Odisha, with capacity to produce up to 100 engines annually for indigenous helicopters, including Dhruv and Prachand. The move follows a previous production line in India.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "HAL plans to establish a new Shakti engine production line at the Koraput facility in Odisha.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The production line will cater to indigenous helicopter platforms, including Dhruv and Prachand.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The new line is expected to increase HAL's capacity for Shakti engines.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
